WEBVTT


00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.220
Hey, The FACE

00:00:02.221 --> 00:00:04.380
I'm Myha’la, and we're at McQueen in Paris

00:00:04.381 --> 00:00:07.800
Who was the first actor that you ever became obsessed with?

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.580
Bernadette Peters in Into the Woods on Broadway,

00:00:10.861 --> 00:00:12.180
filmed version of Into the Woods

00:00:12.181 --> 00:00:13.840
She plays the witch and she's perfect

00:00:13.841 --> 00:00:15.460
What is your favourite curse word?

00:00:15.525 --> 00:00:16.191
C*nt

00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:17.860
Doesn't feel like a curse word, though

00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:19.300
Do you know what I mean? When you're British,

00:00:19.301 --> 00:00:20.660
I mean, it is a curse word,

00:00:20.661 --> 00:00:22.340
but I feel like you can just use it

00:00:22.341 --> 00:00:24.220
However you want

00:00:24.221 --> 00:00:26.244
Who is your favourite character in the industry? 

00:00:26.245 --> 00:00:28.860
Eric Tao

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:29.736
God bless him
